comments.body:
The first time I did it I almost fell over laughing!&nbsp; It's the cutest end scene ever!&nbsp; And c'mon now.&nbsp; You can't blame her for being mad.&nbsp; If the positions were reversed, you'd probably be mad at your absentminded wife for wandering off AGAIN, taking FOREVER, and then NOT bringing home food, right?&nbsp; ;)&nbsp; I love the humor Bliz puts into some of their quests.&nbsp; 

And dunno if it'll help some other druids out there (unless you're gonna try stealthing it), but while I was trying to find the name of this quest (it's been awhile since I've done it on my other chars), I came across some advice from someone else - on Allakhazam, I believe.&nbsp; Someone advised druids to have fun with Soothe Animal.&nbsp; I completely forgot I had that spell, and it helped a lot.&nbsp; Especially with the damn aggro happy hyenas.&nbsp; The only time I had to fight during the quest was when I had 2 of the mobs resist.&nbsp; Other than that, smooth sailing.&nbsp; 

Good luck!&nbsp; Enjoy the end show.&nbsp; ;)
